summary:
  The measurement's first round is named after the sound it does not make.

history:
  With the sweep chosen the row read "clicks through every speaker" for
  the whole first round, seen on a real panel on 2026-11-12. A hand-started
  run with the sweep never falls back to clicks, so the setting says which
  sound is playing.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                                      : Plasmoid.configuration.syncUltrasonic !== false ? i18n("Round 1 of 2 — measuring with a tone too high to hear…")

replace:
                                      : Plasmoid.configuration.syncUltrasonic === false ? i18n("Round 1 of 2 — measuring with a tone too high to hear…")

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_way_out_of_a_measurement_stands_where_its_button_stood.
  Line-neutral.
